'''Candle''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is black with a whiteish purple candle that has a lit purple wick, hence the name. The guard is light gray, and the handle is solid black.

